OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F373A1793193971
OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSATrain attacker 'asked man do you
OL,4,Awant to die?'
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpening the prosecution case at
OL,7,FCambridge Crown Court, Christopher
OL,8,FPaxton KC said that of those on the
OL,9,Ftrain "some stood tall, to protect
OL,10,Fothers trying to de-escalate his
OL,11,Frampage".
OL,13,FWilliams, of Langford Road in
OL,14,FPeterborough, denies 14 counts of
OL,15,Fattempted murder.
